2026-08-01 00:00:00.0000000
2026-07-30 00:00:00.0000000
1969-12-30 00:00:00.0000000
\N
-- bin_at still agrees with bin when the fixed point is the epoch --
2026-08-01 12:00:00.0000000
1969-12-31 00:00:00.0000000
